---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';
---

<Layout
  title={`Privacy Policy - ${SITE_NAME}`}
  description="Privacy policy for Open Allergy Cards: free card use, Stripe checkout, and what data we do and do not store."
>
  <section class="section prose-page">
    <h2>Privacy policy</h2>
    <p>
      Open Allergy Cards is designed to stay simple. Creating and downloading a free allergy card
      does not require an account.
    </p>
    <h3>Free site use</h3>
    <p>
      Browsing cards and downloading PNGs happens in your browser. We do not ask for a login or store
      a personal profile for free downloads.
    </p>
    <h3>Paid orders</h3>
    <p>
      If you order a plastic card, payment and shipping details are processed by Stripe. Stripe holds
      payment data according to their policies. Order details needed for fulfillment (allergen,
      language, optional name, shipping address) appear in the Stripe Dashboard for us to print and
      ship your card.
    </p>
    <h3>Analytics and hosting</h3>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on Cloudflare. Standard hosting logs may include technical data such as IP
      addresses. We do not sell your personal information.
    </p>
    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>
      Privacy questions: see our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
